<div class="wrap prose"><h1 class="ph">Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated 2026-10-26 · Operated by Gil Ventures LLC</p>
<p>SkillMaxx is a free directory. We try to collect as little as possible.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> if you subscribe, your email address is stored by our newsletter provider, Beehiiv, to send the weekly email. Every email has an unsubscribe link.</li>
<li><strong>Forms:</strong> if you submit a tool, a sponsor inquiry or sponsor assets, what you type is emailed to us via FormSubmit. We use it only to reply and to do what you asked.</li>
<li><strong>Payments:</strong> sponsor payments are handled by Stripe. We never see or store your full card number. Stripe shares your name, email and billing details with us for receipts and invoices.</li>
<li><strong>Hosting logs:</strong> the site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log IP addresses for security. We don't run ad trackers.</li>
</ul>
<h2>What we don't do</h2>
<p>We don't sell your data, and we don't share it except with the services above to run the site, the newsletter and payments.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>Unsubscribe from any email, or ask us to delete what we hold about you: <a href="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai">skillmaxx@gilventures.ai</a>.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If this changes, we'll update the date above.</p></div>
